WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: In Labels, choose Add label template or edit through a template’s menu.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Choose its category, name and company-approved timing rules.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:37.250
Step 3: Use Add a field in the toolbar. Click a field to select it, then drag its body or resize handles. Use move arrows, text-size buttons and Undo move for quick adjustments. Snap uses fine 0.25 mm steps plus alignment guides. Switch it off or hold Alt while dragging for free movement. Double-click or use Edit field for full formatting. Preview hides editing boxes. Done keeps a field edit, closing cancels it, and Save commits the template.

4
00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:43.250
Step 4: Configure the printer/media resolution and test a preview before normal printing.
